-- Retargeted from tests/conformance/data_types/positivity-recorded-nonpositive-param-reject/main.kp (Spec 107 module-SCC/induction-recursion revision, 2026-08-01).
-- Positivity failures now use family kappa.data.strict-positivity / E_DATA_STRICT_POSITIVITY (§10.4.2);
-- recorded external parameter-positivity signatures are still consulted, so the rejection stands.
--! mode check
--! assertDiagnostic error E_DATA_STRICT_POSITIVITY
-- §10.4.2 recorded signatures: Contra is accepted in another module with a
-- non-positive parameter signature. Importing that type must not make its
-- parameter position positive for later strict-positivity checks.
module main

import lib.(type Contra)

data Bad : Type =
    MkBad (Contra Bad)
